Description: VeltOS desktop experience for KDE Plasma
 System-wide defaults that turn a stock KDE Plasma 6 session into the VeltOS
 desktop:
  * "VeltOS Light" (default) and "VeltOS Dark" global themes with a
    centered, Windows 11 style taskbar layout for new users;
  * Windows 11 inspired application style (Kvantum), window frames
    (Aurorae) and panel theme, derived from Fluent-kde in VeltOS colours;
  * VeltOS Start, a Windows 11 style start menu (search, pinned apps,
    recommended files, account and power buttons);
  * Fluent icons and cursors and the Inter UI font;
  * VeltOS colour schemes derived from Fluent-kde;
  * the "Velt Bloom" wallpaper (light and dark variants), login splash,
    lock screen and SDDM login background;
  * the VeltOS logo, used for the application launcher button;
  * Windows-familiar application names ("File Explorer", "Settings",
    "Task Manager", ...) without changing other packages' files, fewer
    developer tools in Start, and a simpler Settings page list;
  * File Explorer defaults: Windows-like side bar, zip files open like
    folders.
 .
 Existing users' Plasma configuration is not modified.
